flowchart LR
    A[Decision Request] --> B[Authority Check]
    B --> C[Policy and Guardrail Check]
    C --> D[Evidence Retrieval]
    D --> E[Tool Calls]
    E --> F[Decision Mode]
    F --> G[Commit or Refuse]
    G --> H[Customer-Visible Outcome]
    H --> I[Decision Replay Card]

    I --> I1[Correlation ID]
    I --> I2[Acting Principal]
    I --> I3[Policy Version]
    I --> I4[Evidence]
    I --> I5[Tool Calls]
    I --> I6[Commit Token]
    I --> I7[Reversal Link]
